<title>CHINA: China Jan-March sugar imports down 53.1 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-March sugar imports down 53.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 60,000 tonnes of sugar in the first quarter, down by 53.1 percent from the same 1996 period, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	  IMPORTS JAN-MARCH     MARCH    YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Sugar    60,000		 20,000    -53.1</p>
<p>	  EXPORTS JAN-MARCH     MARCH    YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Sugar     35,301		 14,681    -84.2</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
